ole":0,"stats":[70,29,72,69,68,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1049","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,29,72,69,68,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10011","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,29,72,69,68,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国官臣，将领。诸葛亮病逝后，孙权令全琮在蜀国边界屯兵，蒋琬为之烦恼时，宗预自告奋勇出使吴国，巧辩孙权后，得知了孙权用意后，又成功全身而退。还蜀后迁后将军，督永安，就拜征西大将军，赐爵关内侯。蜀汉灭亡后宗预内徙洛阳，道病卒。","tc":"蜀國官臣，將領。諸葛亮病逝后，孫權令全琮在蜀國邊界屯兵，蔣琬為之煩惱時，宗預自告奮勇出使吳國，巧辯孫權后，得知了孫權用意后，又成功全身而退。還蜀后遷后將軍，督永安，就拜征西大將軍，賜爵關內侯。蜀漢滅亡后宗預內徙洛陽，道病卒。","en":"An official and general of Shu. After Zhuge Liang's death, Sun Quan ordered Quan Cong to station troops along the Shu border. When Jiang Wan was troubled by this situation, Zong Yu volunteered to serve as envoy to Wu, where he skillfully debated Sun Quan, discerned Sun Quan's true intentions, and managed to return safely. Upon his return to Shu, he was promoted to Rear Commander, placed in command of Yongan, and later elevated to Grand General Who Conquers the West, with the noble rank of Marquis Within the Passes. After the fall of Shu-Han, Zong Yu was relocated to Luoyang but fell ill and died en route.","jp":"蜀の官臣、将領。諸葛亮の病没後、孫権が全琮に命じて蜀との国境に軍を駐屯させ、蒋琬がこれに苦慮していたところ、宗預は自ら志願して呉への使者となった。巧みな弁舌で孫権に対峙してその真意を探り出し、無事に役目を果たして帰還した。蜀に戻ると後将軍に遷り、永安を統括し、その地で征西大将軍に拝され、関内侯の爵位を賜った。蜀漢滅亡後、宗預は洛陽へと移住させられる途中で病没した。","kr":"촉나라의 관료이자 장수이다. 제갈량이 병사한 후 손권이 전종에게 촉나라 국경에 주둔하도록 명하여 장완이 이를 고심하자, 종예가 자청하여 오나라에 사신으로 갔다. 빼어난 언변으로 손권을 상대하여 그의 진의를 알아낸 뒤 무사히 몸을 보전하여 돌아왔다. 촉으로 귀환한 후에는 후장군으로 승진하여 영안을 통솔하였고, 정서대장군에 배수되어 관내후의 작위를 받았다. 촉한이 멸망한 후 낙양으로 이주하던 도중에 병으로 사망했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10513","remark":"","surname":"宗","surnameTc":"宗","surnameEn":"Zong","surnameJp":"宗","surnameKr":"종","surnameOther":"","name":"预","nameTc":"預","nameEn":"Yu","nameJp":"預","nameKr":"예","nameOther":"","word":"德艳","wordTc":"德艷","wordEn":"Deyan","wordJp":"徳艶","wordKr":"덕염","wordOther":"","icon":"宗预","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"211","city":"CS1049","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"29","wise":"72","politics":"69","charm":"68","will":"66","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"7/7/7/7/7/69/27/7","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"800","debateSoulPoint":"5100","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000405;1001515","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/0/3/0/1/0/3/1/2/0/0/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"50","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"181","show":"211","death":"264","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1018405","helmet":"WP1027105","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;27/1;43/1;29/1;31/1;42/1;59/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYea